## User question:
How to configure a Nokia router to enable BGP ORF negotiation for receiving route filters from a peer?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to enable BGP ORF negotiation for receiving route filters from a peer, you need to enable the `send-orf` command under the BGP neighbor configuration. Here are the appropriate CLI configuration commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp>group>neighbor>outbound-route-filtering>extended-community
send-orf
```

This command enables the router to negotiate the send capability in the BGP outbound route filtering (ORF) negotiation with its peers.
