  no advertise-inactive
```

Explanation:
- `router-id <your-router-id>`: Specifies the router ID to be used with this BGP instance. Choose an appropriate IP address for your router.
- `no advertise-inactive`: Disables the advertising of inactive BGP routes to other BGP peers. This helps in suppressing unstable route advertisements while ensuring that only stable routes are advertised, thus maintaining convergence.
