config>router>bgp>next-hop-resolution
    policy <policy-name>
```

Replace `<policy-name>` with a name of your choice. You would then need to define the policy details to ensure that only explicitly tagged LSPs are used for next-hop resolution. However, the exact configuration of the policy is not provided in the given reference content, so you would need to refer to the policy configuration section of the manual for further details on how to define the policy rules.
