        permit label-ipv4
        permit label-ipv6
        deny
    end-policy
end-next-hop-resolution

# Apply the policy to BGP
config>router>bgp
    policy my_policy
end-router
```

Note: The exact syntax might vary slightly based on the specific Nokia router model and version. Ensure to refer to the official documentation for your specific device for accurate syntax and additional details.
