## User question:
How to enable updated BGP error handling procedures on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable updated BGP error handling procedures on a Nokia router, you need to configure the `extended-nh-encoding` feature. Here are the appropriate CLI configuration commands:

```plaintext
extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
```

These commands instruct BGP to advertise the capability to receive label IPv4 and VPN IPv4 routes, ensuring that peers do not send such routes unless they have been notified of this capability. This helps in handling malformed UPDATE messages more effectively.
