## Proposed answer:
To configure next-hop-resolution options for labeled-unicast IPv6 routes on a Nokia router, you need to set a policy that will be used for next-hop resolution. Here is the appropriate CLI configuration command:

```
policy next-hop-resolution-policy
```

You would need to define the details of the policy `next-hop-resolution-policy` according to your specific requirements, but the above command sets up the policy context for next-hop resolution.
