---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a BGP inbound route policy named "CustomerX_Policy" with a secondary fallback policy expression "LocalPref_100" for specific neighbor route handling, you can use the following CLI commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp>group>neighbor
  export CustomerX_Policy
  export LocalPref_100
