## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per unlabeled IPv4 unicast prefix and disable receiving multiple routes per prefix, you need to configure the `label-ipv4` command under the BGP configuration. Here are the appropriate CLI configuration commands:

