## User question:
How to configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 labeled-unicast IPv4 paths per prefix and negotiate to receive multiple paths?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 labeled-unicast IPv4 paths per prefix and negotiate to receive multiple paths, you need to use the following CLI commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp>label-ipv4 send 8 receive
```

This command sets the maximum number of paths per labeled-unicast IPv4 prefix to 8 and enables the negotiation to receive multiple labeled-unicast routes per IPv4 prefix.
