## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 labeled-unicast IPv6 paths per prefix while disabling the ability to receive multiple such routes, you need to focus on enabling the `label-ipv6` feature for BGP rapid update and disabling the capability negotiation for receiving multiple labeled-unicast IPv6 routes.

