## User question:
"How to configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 different paths per multicast IPv4 VPN prefix and enable negotiation to receive multiple routes?"
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 different paths per multicast IPv4 VPN prefix and enable negotiation to receive multiple routes, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp
  add-paths

config>router>bgp>mvpn-ipv4
  send 8
  receive
```

These commands enable the `add-paths` feature globally for BGP and specifically for multicast IPv4 VPN routes, allowing the router to send and receive up to 8 paths per prefix.
