---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per multicast IPv4 VPN prefix while disabling the ability to receive multiple routes for the same prefix, use the following CLI configuration commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp>mvpn-ipv4 send 8
config>router>bgp>mvpn-ipv4 receive none
```

These commands ensure that the router advertises up to 8 paths per multicast IPv4 VPN prefix and does not negotiate the capability to receive multiple routes for the same prefix.
