## User question:
How to configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per multicast IPv6 VPN prefix and negotiate to receive multiple multicast routes per IPv6 VPN prefix?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 paths per multicast IPv6 VPN prefix and negotiate to receive multiple multicast routes per IPv6 VPN prefix, you can use the following CLI configuration commands:

```plaintext
ipv6 mvpn
address-family ipv6 unicast
multicast-routing
maximum-paths 8
exit
exit
```

These commands enable multicast routing, set the maximum number of paths to 8 for each IPv6 multicast prefix, and configure the router to negotiate for receiving multiple multicast routes per IPv6 prefix.
