## Proposed answer:
To disable BGP monitoring on a Nokia router, you need to disable capability negotiation and disable rapid withdrawal. Here are the appropriate CLI configuration commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp>group
no disable-capability-negotiation

config>router>bgp>group>neighbor
no disable-capability-negotiation

config>router>bgp
no rapid-withdrawal
```
