{'Parameters': 'send-limit', 'Info': 'Specifies the maximum number of paths per multicast VPN IPv6 prefix that are allowed to be advertised to add-paths peers. The actual number of advertised routes may be less. If the value is none, the router does not negotiate the send capability with respect to multicast VPN IPv6 AFI/SAFI.'}
{'Parameters': 'receive', 'Info': 'Specifies that the router negotiates to receive multiple multicast VPN routes per IPv6 prefix.'}
{'Parameters': 'none', 'Info': 'Specifies that the router does not negotiate to receive multiple multicast VPN routes per IPv6 prefix.'}
