## User question:
Enable inter-AS label security for VPN IPv6 family on a Nokia router.
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable inter-AS label security for VPN IPv6 family on a Nokia router, you need to configure the `label-ipv6` parameter under the BGP configuration context. Here are the appropriate CLI configuration commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp
    label-ipv6
```

This command includes label-IPv6 routes in the set of routes that can trigger rapid update, which is related to inter-AS label security.
