## Proposed answer:
To enable inter-AS label security for both VPN IPv4 and VPN IPv6 families on a Nokia router, you need to configure the `extended-nh-encoding` command to include the necessary capabilities for label IPv4 and VPN IPv4 for both IPv4 and IPv6 address families. Here are the appropriate CLI configuration commands:

```plaintext
extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
extended-nh-encoding label-ipv6
