## Proposed answer:
To configure parameters for resolving next-hop addresses in a Nokia router's BGP context, you need to enter the following CLI commands:

```
config>router>bgp>group>neighbor>extended-nh-encoding [ label-ipv4 ] [ vpn-ipv4 ]
