---
## Proposed answer:
To disable the sending of BGP filter lists to peers on a Nokia router, you should use the `no mcast-vpn-ipv6` command. This will ensure that the router does not negotiate the send capability with respect to multicast IPv6 VPN AFI/SAFI, effectively disabling the sending of BGP filter lists to peers for multicast IPv6 VPN routes.

Here is the appropriate CLI configuration command:

```
no mcast-vpn-ipv6
```
