## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia router's BGP session to track neighbor reachability using a route policy named "core-routes-only", you need to use the `peer-tracking-policy` command under the BGP configuration context. Here are the appropriate CLI configuration commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp
  peer-tracking-policy core-routes-only
