## User question:
How to enable BGP next-hop resolution for labeled routes using gRPC-programmed tunnels on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable BGP next-hop resolution for labeled routes using gRPC-programmed tunnels on a Nokia router, you need to configure the `transport-tunnel` command under the BGP labeled routes next-hop resolution context. Here are the necessary CLI configuration commands:

```
config>router>bgp>next-hop-res>labeled-routes
    transport-tunnel
```
