To configure a Nokia router to enable BGP resolution of next-hops for labeled routes using IGP route table lookups when acting as a Route Reflector without tunnel signaling protocol participation, you need to configure the following commands:

```cli
config>router>bgp
    extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
    extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
    enable-notification
    link-state-import-enable
```

These commands enable the necessary features for BGP to handle labeled routes and use IGP route tables for next-hop resolution while acting as a Route Reflector.
