---
## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia routers to enable resolution of unlabeled BGP routes using tunnel types under BGP next-hop resolution, you need to set a policy that controls which IP routes in RTM are eligible to resolve the BGP next-hop addresses. Here are the appropriate CLI configuration commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp>next-hop-resolution
    policy <policy-name>
```

Replace `<policy-name>` with a suitable name for your policy. This command specifies the policy to be used for BGP next-hop resolution, ensuring that the policy controls which IP routes in RTM are eligible to resolve the BGP next-hop addresses.
