## User question:
Configure Nokia router to set the maximum interval between SPF calculations to 120 seconds, with initial delay of 10 seconds and secondary delay of 20 seconds for BGP optimal route reflection.
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure the Nokia router to set the maximum interval between SPF calculations to 120 seconds, with an initial delay of 10 seconds and a secondary delay of 20 seconds for BGP optimal route reflection, you would need to use the following commands:

```plaintext
config>router>ospf
ospf [instance-id]
  max-metric router-lsa external-lsa summary-lsa
