## Proposed answer:
To enable Segment Routing tunnel selection by TE instances for BGP next-hop resolution on a Nokia router, you need to configure the `extended-nh-encoding` command. However, the provided reference content does not explicitly mention a command for enabling Segment Routing tunnel selection by TE instances. Given the available commands, you can enable the extended next-hop encoding for label IPv4 and/or VPN IPv4, which might be related to the Segment Routing functionality.

Here are the configuration commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp
    extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4
    extended-nh-encoding vpn-ipv4
