## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia routers to enable tunnel-based next-hop resolution for BGP labeled IPv6 unicast routes, you need to use the `policy` command to specify a policy that controls the resolution of BGP next-hop addresses for IPv6 routes. Here is the appropriate CLI configuration command:

```plaintext
policy tunnel-based-next-hop-resolution
