## Proposed answer:
To configure Nokia routers to enable non-disruptive handling of BGP UPDATE message errors when no length errors prevent NLRI field parsing, you need to enable the `error-handling` command under the BGP configuration context. Here are the appropriate CLI configuration commands:

```
config>router>bgp
  error-handling
```
