## User question:
How to enable BGP import route policy application for VPN-related routes on a Nokia router?
---
## Proposed answer:
To enable BGP import route policy application for VPN-related routes on a Nokia router, you need to configure the `leak-import` command under the appropriate BGP context. Here is the appropriate CLI configuration command:

```plaintext
leak-import <policy-name>
```

Replace `<policy-name>` with the name of your route policy that controls the importation of leak-eligible routes from the BGP RIB of another routing instance into the unlabeled-IPv4, unlabeled-IPv6, or labeled-IPv4 RIB of the base router.
