## User question:
How to configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 diverse VPN-IPv4 paths to BGP peers while disabling the receive capability?
---
## Proposed answer:
To configure a Nokia router to advertise up to 8 diverse VPN-IPv4 paths to BGP peers while disabling the receive capability, you need to use the following CLI commands:

```plaintext
config>router>bgp>group>neighbor>add-paths
    mvpn-ipv4 send 8 receive none
```

These commands enable the `mvpn-ipv4` feature to send up to 8 paths to BGP peers and disable the receive capability for these additional paths.
