config>router>bgp>vpn-ipv6 send 8 receive none
```

3. Disable the add-paths receive capability globally:
```shell
config>router>bgp no add-paths
```

These commands ensure that the router advertises up to 8 diverse VPN-IPv6 paths and does not accept multiple paths from its peers.
