## Proposed answer:
To enable weighted load balancing for 6PE traffic over RSVP-TE tunnels on a Nokia router, you would typically need to configure the BGP group and neighbor settings to include specific attributes related to load balancing. However, the provided reference content does not contain any commands specifically for enabling weighted load balancing for 6PE traffic over RSVP-TE tunnels. 

Given the available commands, you can start by configuring the BGP group and neighbor settings. Here is an example of how you might configure the BGP group and neighbor settings:

```plaintext
config> router> bgp
